sequenceDiagram
actor U as 用户
participant V as MainWindow
participant L as LoginController
participant M as LoginModel
participant C as SessionController
participant N as SignalClient
participant S as SignalServer
U->>V: 点击退出登录或关闭窗口
V-->>L: logoutRequested
L->>M: logout 清除内存会话
M-->>L: changed
L->>V: 返回登录页
M-->>C: changed
C->>C: 停止到期定时器，清除待处理请求
C->>N: disconnectFromServer
N->>N: 停止心跳和请求定时器，abort socket
N-->>C: disconnected，清空房间状态
S->>S: 连接断开，清理成员或关闭主播房间
S-->>S: 向剩余观众发送 room.closed 或 room.updated
Note over M,S: 签名令牌暂未中心撤销，但退出客户端不再保留凭据
